      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Found Asset Categories that do not have CIP accounts defined for the associated TAX books.',
      p_solution               => 'Tax book categories do not have the required CIP accounts specified although ''Allow CIP Assets'' checkbox is enabled.<br><br>
ACTION - Define CIP accounts for the associated TAX books.<br>
Navigation: Setup > Asset System > Asset Categories',
