Bug 7292561 - AFTER 6860984 BACKDATED RETIREMENTS XFR > GL BASED ON EVENT DATE VS FA PERIOD

<p><u>Note:</u><br>
The event date should be set to the calendar_period_close_date of the period in which the transaction
occurred (based on effective_date, not transaction_date_entered).
</p>',
      p_solution               => 'Please log a Service Request, for possible datafix, referring to this internal [804686/KB782231] - How To Datafix FA Events Having Incorrect Event Date And Were Not Transferred To GL and provide SQL output in SR.',
