APP-OFA-48392 Assets Transaction upgrade is either running or incomplete for one or more reporting <br> currencies associated with primary depreciation book.  You must first complete the upgrade before <br> entering transactions in this book. <br><br>

CAUSE<br>
-----------------------<br>
There were already assets in the book when the ALC ledger was created for the ledger the asset book<br> belongs to and the ALC ledger setup was incomplete.<br> 
